== Nepean Museum special_hours
- NOTICE "The museum will be closed on the following public holidays:"
    effects: closure
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    phrase: "museum"
    at: facility
- IGNORED date-context "Thursday, December 25"
    at: facility
- IGNORED date-context "Friday, December 26"
    at: facility
- IGNORED date-context "Thursday, January 1"
    at: facility
